INSERT INTO `everlake_forge_stage` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `EmoteOnCompleteDelay`, `EmoteOnIncompleteDelay`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(78261, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The chest sits, empty.>', 0),
(78270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You said you\'re breaking into Shadowfang...alone? You\'ve got some guts!$B$BI can hook you up with explosives to get past the gate, but I\'ll need a work order to make it look legit on the books. An employee around here\'s likely carrying one. Probably someone who does a lot of tinkering or building.', 0),
(78676, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The chest sits, empty.>', 0),
(86585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That banner looks like it\'s been in a war!', 0),
(86776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Gotta keep the forges going!', 0),
(87492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Be careful out there!', 0),
(88756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This war against the Dark Irons just keeps going on and on!', 0),
(91294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Welcome to Bandarion Keep, $C. It\'s always good to see a new face.', 0),
(91316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'They say location is everything. While this fortress may look imposing perched upon these bluffs, it\'s turning out to be quite the challenge to stay supplied this far from proper civilization. An unfortunate oversight on our part.', 0),
(91317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Tarnished threaten what little goodwill we have with the other Forsaken. As much as it pains me to cross blades with our former brothers and sisters, they must be stopped if our fledgling order is to survive.', 0),
(91733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Did you find the supplies?', 0),
(91775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Have you found all the books yet?', 0),
(91777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Have you found all my missing books yet?', 0),
(92415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What is it, $N? What are you looking for?', 0),
(92456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well? Do you have it yet?', 0),
(92458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What good is our pride if there isn\'t a city left standing to be proud of?', 0),
(92466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Al\'Aketh cult represents the most direct and urgent danger to our homeland. Their increasingly extremist actions have destabilized our society and damaged our already-weakened connection to the spirits of the four winds. The elements demand action to prove our resilience and resolve, which are traits that are endemic to the domain of the element of earth.', 0),
(92483, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Akeri eyes you suspiciously.>', 0),
(92528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What did you learn?', 0),
(92532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So you\'ve come for training, then?', 0),
(92595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The world is changing and the path forward will be difficult. We have but one chance to save ourselves.', 0),
(92812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Long ago, all of the centaur clans in the Desolace agreed to trade in story. Specifically, carved totems that represent an individual or clan\'s great accomplishments. Despite the endless conflict, all clans continue to honor this tradition, even if trade opportunities between us have become few and far between.$B$BShould you collect any, such as from fallen centaur of other clans, bring them to me. The Gelkis can use more bartering power, and I will inform the Khan of your assistance.', 0),
(93159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So that\'s the story...', 0),
(93172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We can only hope that those poor spirits are able to find peace after being freed from this place.', 0),
(93787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Returned with our supplies?', 0),
(94003, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Seena nods curtly at you.>', 0),
(94004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wut?', 0),
(94212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Come, warm yourself by the fire.', 0),
(94213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good day, $R. I appreciate the company but my attention is elsewhere. If we do not have business, please be on your way.', 0),
(94214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Heyo, for future reference, you shouldn\'t come charging at full-speed toward a goblin with a bodyguard! You never know what might happen.', 0),
(94215, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<You approach a thrashing creature clearly trapped in spider silk, at the precise location the writ indicated.>', 0),
(94216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Are you here about...$B$B<Ziz looks around his tiny hut suspiciously, and lowers his voice.>$B$BThe elixir?', 0),
(94217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Yarr, you be bringin\' me my elixir?', 0),
(94218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'If YOU are the assassin that the crewmen keep warning me about, well, you had better think twice before charging at ME, buster!', 0),
(94227, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The chicken... clears its throat?>$B$BCluck, cluck.', 0),
(94229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Whoa! I almost didn\'t see you there. I might have seen you coming sooner if a damned engineer would at last deliver my order.', 0),
(94230, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The distraught woman peers into the nearby farmstead. She notices you approach a moment before it might have startled her.>$B$BPlease tell me you are delivering one of my crafting orders!', 0),
(94233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I watched this whole place get burned to the ground and that keep toppled over. It was glorious.$B$BNever expected a group of bandits to try using this place as a base of operations.', 0),
(94235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Careful where you walk, Gizmo! This thing likes to activate when you least expect it, and we don\'t quite have a handle on where it can take you when we aren\'t actively manning the controls.', 0),
(94243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Need some work?', 0),
(94247, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The man stands at attention, peering over the mountainside toward Dalaran. He regards your presence with a subtle wave of a hand, beckoning you closer.>', 0),
(94248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh! Please keep your voice down--we don\'t need to draw any further attention to ourselves.$B$BDo you have something for me?', 0),
(94249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'AHHHH! Oh, it just a $R.$B$BHi $R!', 0),
(94434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I hope that this is no imposition upon you, goodly $C.', 0),
(94440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What news of Deathguard Falgan?', 0),
(94466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aye, I\'ve near all I need for the fire sapta, $N--just missin\' the fire tar and the seer\'s pouch. The tar\'s carried by Tunnel Rat Geomancers in the kobold caves up north. The pouch ye\'ll need to wrest from a Stonesplinter seer in the southern hills. These ingredients are bound to flame, as all true saptas must be. Their elemental ties make our craft strong.', 0),
(94467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The brazier stands about a third your height, with charred inscriptions along its smooth metal rails. The metal shows no signs of wear from the weather, and the bowl seated at the top of it feels cool to the touch.$B$BBlackrock Mountain looms in the distance, in clear view to honor from this sacred place.', 0),
(94468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aye, $N? What do ye have there?', 0),
(94497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I\'m nearly ready to send ye off on the rest o\' yer tasks. But tell me, have ye filled the skin yet? The ocean brings life, aye--but it carries sediment, minerals, and energies far different from the snowmelt and springwater of the highlands. Where sea and spring meet, there\'s wisdom to be found.', 0),
(94499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The folk o\' Lakeshire don\'t ken how good they\'ve got it--fresh water flowin\' right at their boots, keepin\' their nets full, their crops green, and their coin purses jinglin\'. Even when the kingdom\'s guard can barely spare a lad with a sword, they\'ve got Everstill watchin\' over \'em.', 0),
(94500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Do you have the water yet, $N? If ye haven\'t made the trek to Kalimdor yet, be careful.', 0),
(94501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hello again, $N. Yer looking well.$B$BWhat brings you back to me so soon?', 0),
(94502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The shrine stands aged and forgotten, cloaked in dust and cobwebs. The pond beside it lies eerily still, its surface untouched by wind or life. Scattered along the shore are the bones of beasts once burdened by labor. The water\'s murky sheen raises a troubling question--has it been poisoned by the surrounding malaise, or is it the very source of it?', 0),
(94505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'How fared your journey to Westfall? Success there is hard to measure, but even small victories carry weight.', 0),
(94533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Found my new trophy yet?', 0),
(94535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Have you located the stolen ore?', 0),
(94568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That turncoat risked everything to escape the cult and bring us this crystal...', 0),
(94669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, what\'ll it be?', 0),
(94734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You get food?', 0),
(94884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You look like you found something extra delicious. Come come, show me what you have.', 0),
(94965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So how\'d it go?', 0),
(94968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Has the leader been located?', 0),
(94972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Find anything of interest?', 0),
(94974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Do you have the materials?', 0),
(95036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Trust in the light to guide your blade. However, the light needs a good blade to guide.', 0),
(95183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Not all rocks equal. Some good. Some gooder.', 0),
(95189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Welcome to the gallery. Feel free to browse.', 0),
(95214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I hope you\'ve got good news for me?', 0),
(95420, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The massive ogre belches in your face.>$B$BWhat tiny creature bring Clugfist?', 0),
(95425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What you want? Bring Skullbasher now!', 0),
(95562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The ghosts of this village cry out for vengeance, $N. And we must give it to them.', 0),
(95748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Have you found the tablet?$B$BI hope the Bloodscalp didn\'t give you too much trouble. If they did, I hope you killed them for it.', 0),
(95773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The more reports I get about these well-armed naga, the more I want them gone. Have you taken care of the problem?', 0),
(95775, 0, 0, 0, 0, '$N! You have returned unharmed, and mostly in one piece it seems. Come sit, and tell me; have you ventured to the ruins of the Drowned City?', 0),
(95986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'If you\'re talking to me, I assume the lion is slain?', 0),
(96026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Smith tinies turn rocks into heavy rock. Genius. Maybe you buy from dem?', 0),
(96046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Yes, I can teach you.', 0),
(96101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors is critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle.', 0),
(96104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I have been making whistles and animal calls since I was young. It is a useful skill when hunting certain prey.', 0),
(96105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Come to bring news of your victory?', 0),
(96107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A bit ironic to pluck something from the corpse of a buzzard, isn\'t it?', 0),
(96108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Be careful while gathering the vipers\' venom that you do not succumb to it yourself.', 0),
(96109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Like us, the lions hunt in packs. Be on your guard, and make sure you are not surrounded.', 0),
(96392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Farsight can show ye a great many things, even things ye\'d rather not see.', 0),
(96604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors are critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle.', 0),
(96605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors are critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle.', 0),
(96607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors are critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle.', 0),
(96608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors are critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle.', 0),
(96658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A good campfire is the foundation to any good camp.', 0),
(96659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Are you here to learn about camping in the wilderness?', 0),
(96874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(96984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You were right to come straight back to me. Have you found anything in Dalaran?', 0),
(96997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Have you made your choice? These were once some of the finest horses in all of Lordaeron. Now they serve us in death as they did in life.$B$BThere is no true life in them any longer, though they do still have their own personalities much like you and I.$B$BNo, only an echo of life remains, which means they will not flee in the face of harm but will faithfully stay at your side until their true death.$B$BThey are fitting companions for ones such as ourselves.', 0),
(97244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The heart of a betrayer is a powerful reagent. The flames will eagerly accept such an offering and burn more intensely as it is consumed.', 0),
(97245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The spirit of Kuramaa is eternal, and it will manifest again when it is needed. It\'s mask is a source of great power, and will prove invaluable to the ritual we must complete.', 0),
(97287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, you are back.', 0),
(97328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You look confused. Lost?', 0),
(97534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Don\'t worry about any labels that say hazardous or toxic... I\'ll shred those up and they\'ll be none the wiser!', 0),
(97920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I can teach you once you\'ve gained some skill as a fisherman.', 0),
(97952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Yes, I can teach you.', 0),
(97955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I can teach you once you\'ve gained some skill with your profession.', 0),
(97956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I can teach you once you\'ve gained some skill as a fisherman.', 0),
(97959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You\'ve come to learn, then?', 0),
(97967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I can teach you once you\'ve gained some skill as a fisherman.', 0),
(98203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ya go findin\' Ti\'ik in his cave of larvae?', 0),
(98247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, greetings! How can I be of assistance?', 0),
(98342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, you have returned. I do hope you have brought the relics with you?', 0),
(98424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What is it you bring me, $C?', 0),
(98512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I wonder what they are after?', 0),
(98574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, another $R comin\' ta learn about the Light! You\'ll find that deepening your connection to the Light relies on curiosity and intelligence, qualities that many gnomes have in abundance. The way o\' the Light isn\'t a technical discipline, it\'s a riddle, and one that provides both life lessons and practical blessings.', 0),
(98889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What news from the Darkspear Islands, $N?', 0),
(99080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Is the deed done?', 0),
(99101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What is it you bring me, $C?', 0),
(99128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Are they dead?', 0),
(99130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Find everything?', 0),
(99143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What did you find? Anything interesting?', 0),
(99191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The High Order are currently accepting donations for wool cloth.$B$BA donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by the High Order for your generous actions. Sixty pieces of wool should prove to be a sufficient amount for the High Order\'s needs for now.$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.', 0),
(99197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Windshapers presently find ourselves in need of silk cloth. If you could spare sixty pieces of silk then we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.$B$BA fine gift such as silk would certainly increase your honor and esteem amongst the Windshapers!$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `EmoteOnCompleteDelay`, `EmoteOnIncompleteDelay`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) SELECT `ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `EmoteOnCompleteDelay`, `EmoteOnIncompleteDelay`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild` FROM `everlake_forge_stage`;
INSERT IGNORE INTO `everlake_import_rows` (`tbl`, `k1`, `k2`, `k3`, `k4`, `file`, `note`) SELECT 'quest_request_items', s.`ID`, 0, 0, 0, '2026_11_14_900_world_everlake_forge_00023_import.sql', 'Forge #23: ForeverChanges 2026-11-14' FROM `everlake_forge_stage` s;
INSERT INTO `everlake_forge_stage` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(78261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<You place The Horn of Xelthos into the chest>', 0),
(78270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Nice job, $N. I figure that was a cakewalk for someone in your line of work.$B$BAs promised, here\'s the goods.', 0),
(78676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<You place The Eye of Bhossca into the chest>', 0),
(86776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, this is a relief! I should be able to keep the forge going now. Hopefully one of these days we\'ll get a trader bringing coal into town regularly!', 0),
(87491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That was quite a pyrotechnic display! I don\'t think I\'ve seen anything quite like it!$B$BGlad the fire elemental, uh, ran outta steam, as it were. Coulda been bad if it had decided to go after the rest of us instead of those Dark Irons!', 0),
(87492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Let\'s have a look at this!$B$BIt has delicate cracks, and tiny bits of powder coming off, but what\'s more interesting is these striations. This crystal isn\'t anything like the natural stone underneath the soil here. These growths... there\'s something unnatural about them. I don\'t know what it is, but it\'s like something caused these crystals to grow all through the region.$B$BDisturbing, but what could it mean?', 0),
(88756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ach, that\'s a load off me mind. At least the Dark Irons won\'t be able to roll a bomb-cart into our wagons... or lob \'em in a trebuchet... or roll \'em down the hill at us... or feed \'em tae slimes and then let the slimes loose near are camp and set \'em on fire.$B$BNow we just have tae make sure the powder stays dry!$B$BThanks!', 0),
(91316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I\'m glad to see that your trip to Shadowvale bore fruit. I\'ll send Breton and a few of the other new recruits over later to clear the rest of the cellar out and retrieve anything left down in the dark.', 0),
(91317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent work, $N. Every time one of these Tarnished strike out and kill one of the Forsaken, it becomes that much easier for our detractors to stoke mistrust towards us paladins. Eliminating them will help further our cause and solidify our place here in Tirisfal.$B$BI suspect it may take a long time for us to be fully embraced by the Forsaken and the horde. It could take years... or maybe even decades, but the best we can do is keep trying to prove ourselves.', 0),
(91775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I applaud your diligence, $N. Brother Paxton sent a list of books, and you\'ve found most of the missing ones. The rest must have been taken to the Jasperlode Mine.$B$BYou can keep that book bag!', 0),
(92456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is... not what I had in mind.$B$BClearly the city is going through more than I expected. But what you found is just as fascinating, if not more so.$B$BI guess you\'re not as troublesome as I thought. Good work.', 0),
(92457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thank you $N, this progress will help ensure Dalaran is safe.', 0),
(92458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I don\'t know what you saw up there, $N, but it does not matter. What matters now is containing this mote and putting an end to this madness.$B$BYou did your part well. Now the rest is up to us.', 0),
(92466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have returned and brought what I have requested and thus your grit and determination are unquestionable. You are ready for the next step, $N.', 0),
(92467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah... $N... child of the four winds... You seek understanding. You seek answers. Why have the winds left you? How may you get them back? These are answers I cannot provide, for I do not know the motives or movements of the winds.$B$BI can, however, teach you much of the earth. Its strength, its resolve. Even here, high in this endless sea of clouds, you are still a creature of the earth. If you hope to find the strength to speak to the spirits of the four winds once more, this is the path you must walk.', 0),
(92483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I almost did not hear you approach me, young $C.$B$BAlmost.$B$BAlmost won\'t be good enough when you leave Thendal Grove. You must be a slender blade, silent and steady. Ever vigilant and ever mindful of your surroundings. You might have what it takes to survive the dangers of Zephras. You also might end up with your throat slit in a ditch. Ultimately that\'s entirely up to you.$B$BSpeak with me again if you wish to take your next steps.', 0),
(92489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A creature of pure mana? Whatever is causing this disturbance is more powerful than initial reports suggested.$B$BYour aid bought them precious time and reminded the Kirin Tor who their allies are. Good work, $N.', 0),
(92532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You are about to embark upon a dangerous journey. Our world is changing and it will need those who have the will to lead and protect others if our people hope to survive. As you grow in power you will need guidance. Come to me--I will do what I can to train you as you progress.$B$BGood luck, $N, may the winds guide you.', 0),
(92910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What\'s this?', 0),
(93341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Mithera listens quietly to your explanation of the situation.>$B$BThe pedestal is empty? My necklace is... missing?$B$B<A great sadness washes over her expression.>$B$BI should have expected as much. The quilboar and the centaur have been ravaging these lands for such a short amount of time, but the damage they have already done is immeasurable.$B$B$N, even if the magic is gone from the necklace, I am clinging onto hope that I may have it back. Would you be willing to help?', 0),
(93459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'As promised, here is your reward.', 0),
(93963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, you are back.$B$BI hope your adventures have given you a sense of the scale and wonder of our world. I know it must seem overwhelming to you, but if you are to help your people, you must be prepared for whatever may come your way while you are on Azeroth.$B$BWhile you wait for your order to establish itself in Dalaran, I suggest you turn your attention to the lands around Stormwind. Westfall in particular can always use more strong adventurers to lend them aid, if you are willing.', 0),
(94212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I will admit, I expected the treacherous winds of the highlands to tear that letter to shreds. I had not imagined that someone would see my humble request, let alone deliver it straight to me.$B$BYour efforts are kind and admirable, $R. I will use this to aid my meditation.$B$BFeel free to stay and share a tale or two of your travels. I enjoy the company.', 0),
(94213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, is this the potion I requested?$B$B<The elven woman respectfully takes the vial from you.>$B$BYour arrival is timely, and your generosity deeply appreciated. I accept this, and offer you a small token of my gratitude.$B$BThank you, may we meet again.', 0),
(94214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Then again, when you\'re fulfilling a rush order like this one, I can\'t blame you for wanting to capitalize on your gains.$B$BHere you go, pal. Thanks for hooking a goblin up with some much-needed shadow protection potions. Have you SEEN the stuff that goes on out here?', 0),
(94215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<You waste little time offering the wiggling mass the Free Action Potion that was requested. It seems either unaware of your presence, or unable to claim the item.$B$BA handful of coins are scattered just beside the cocoon. You may decide to leave the potion there, and take the coins for yourself. Nature will surely sort itself out, in that case.>', 0),
(94216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Ziz continues to talk in a hushed tone.>$B$BI\'m not about to give you the whole spiel about how I got into this position, but here\'s some advice for you.$B$BSometimes, all you gotta do to impress your new boss is take credit for someone else\'s work. So you\'re going to hand over the elixir, and I am gonna talk about how much blood, sweat, and tears I poured into making it.$B$BIt\'s a new gig, okay? I need to make a good first impression!', 0),
(94217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Exactly what Short John Mithril ordered!$B$BHere\'s ye\' coin. I\'d keep it clutched to your chest as ye\' scuttle out of here, the arena combatants thirst for riches as much as they thirst for blood!', 0),
(94219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Water breathing draughts are a necessity if you plan to camp out here during the rainy nights. I tend to take my naps under that bridge over there, but sometimes the underside gets flooded.$B$BNow, I can sleep easy knowing my nightmares of drowning are only just nightmares.$B$BCome to think of it, I probably should have ordered some to resell...', 0),
(94221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, the Golden Rod I requested. I never expected it to arrive. I was considering going back to Ironforge to purchase one off the auction house. You saved me a trip, something these old feet greatly thank you for.$B$BI do not yet know how I can use this to commune with the Binding Stones, let alone if I even can, but I suspect this brings me one step closer.$B$BIn the worst case, well, I am happy to have a new cane.', 0),
(94229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh. Oh! You\'re the engineer? I suppose at the very least you are the delivery boy in any case.$B$BPlease hand over the spyglass. I have little time and many things to inspect.', 0),
(94230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Explosive Sheep? It\'s a bit smaller than I had hoped but...$B$B<She reached out to claim it, but then cautiously took it out from your arms. It did not take long before she delicately placed it down.>$B$BI\'m hoping this does enough damage to scare a few off...', 0),
(94235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Seems we are in luck, the remote has arrived! Looks like you precalibrated it for us which, I\'ll admit, isn\'t ideal for this scenario.$B$BI should be able to reverse engineer it in no time. Then maybe, hopefully, I\'ll be able to take a much needed break. Feels like I\'ve been stuck fumbling with this teleporter\'s controls for months on end!', 0),
(94247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Alan speaks in a whisper.>$B$BDon\'t you think it is a little suspicious to be carrying elegant robes in broad daylight to a man garbed in dark leathers?$B$BWell, ahem, fortunately I am out here on behalf of the Kirin Tor, so there is no shady transaction about to take place. None at all.$B$BThe robe, please.', 0),
(94248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Blue Overalls! Thank goodness, I have a proper change of clothes.$B$BTake this, and please be on your way. I do not have time to chat, I must keep an eye on the farm and can\'t risk more distractions.', 0),
(94249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It da hood me order-er-ed!$B$BMe forgot why wanted in first place, but me take anyway.$B$BHere, take shiny coin. It fell out of slime monster. Lots and lots of them!', 0),
(94255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Are these my new boots?$B$B<Kixxle looks very excited, but it fades immediately upon setting his eyes upon them.>$B$BAh. I thought I had cancelled the order for slippers once I realized how foolish it would be to trudge around a swamp with my toes hanging out. I ordered a new pair of proper boots too, but they still haven\'t arrived yet.$B$BOh well, pleasure doing business with you. I\'ll keep these for later!', 0),
(94434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is very kind of you, $C. Very kind indeed.', 0),
(94435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done well, $N. It was a small thing, but even small acts of service such as this may help strengthen our connection to the light.$B$BThe Dark Lady and many in her service mistrust us. Some even conspire against us, but we will visit their skepticism and fear with courage and righteousness. We will show them that we are members of the Forsaken and we are willing to do our part, be it large or small, to help our people prosper once again.$B$BTake this symbol, you will need it for what comes next.', 0),
(94436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So you\'ll help me, then? Good, good. I\'ll admit I\'m not proud of resorting to... well, resorting to asking paladins for aid. The priests waved me away and you might be my friend\'s only chance.$B$BPlease, help me.', 0),
(94438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I\'m... back? And saved by a $C no less? I see you carry a Symbol of Life. I\'ve not seen one of those since... well, since before the war when Lordaeron was a very different place. I can only assume you are here to help. Billmuth and I were sent here to scout out the scarlet activity here, and we found out that they are planning some kind of attack.$B$BIf you would be willing to help more, there may yet be more that you can do to help the Forsaken.', 0),
(94440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thank you for saving my friend, $N. I will take these plans back to my commander and we will give those crusaders a welcoming they won\'t forget.$B$BI know that many among our people mistrust you paladins, but it\'s clear to me that you are Forsaken through and through. I won\'t forget this, and I\'ll make sure others know of what you did here today.', 0),
(94441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Symbol of Life is only able to be used by a $C who is ready to make use of one of the light\'s greatest blessings. I\'m proud to count you among us, and I now bestow upon you the gift of redemption. With this you will be able to resurrect your fallen companions. Use this new boon wisely.$B$BYou have done well for both the Forsaken as well as the paladins of Bandarion Keep. Any steps we can take to win the hearts and minds of our fellow Forsaken is well worth the effort. Go with the light, $N.', 0),
(94465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, me apologies, $N. Didn\'t spot the Torch in yer hand. An honor to meet ye proper.$B$BMany a wanderer climbs these heights chasin\' tales of treasure or beasts, only to find naught but stone and silence. But we know better, don\'t we, $N?$B$BThis shrine holds truths far deeper than the Alliance can fathom. To us, it\'s a sacred flame that waits to be awakened.', 0),
(94466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'These\'ll do fine, $N.$B$BFire ain\'t just fury and ruin--mark me words. It\'s life, it\'s forge, it\'s the breath o\' creation. All things are bound in balance. One force tempers the other, gives it meaning. Without shadow, light\'s but a glare. Without flame, stone\'s but cold memory.$B$BMasterin\' magic means knowin\' when to blend, not just burn. That\'s true wisdom, lad.', 0),
(94467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A white hot flame ignites within the bowl as you place the ember within. You can feel the magical effects of the sapta coursing through your body and the fire dances rhythmically before you.$B$BYou place the top of the torch within the basin, and it immediately catches on fire. The smoke seems to drift towards the peak of the looming mountain.', 0),
(94481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Any more complaints and they can bring them to me directly.$B$BI am thankful for your work in retrieving this food, as are our warriors, despite what they say.', 0),
(94494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The wind\'s rushin\' at yer back, the stone\'s firm beneath yer boots, and the fire in yer belly\'s burnin\' bright. Aye, it\'s time ye learned the truth o\' water\'s purity. Yer path\'s been long, but it\'s yer spirit that\'ll carry ye further still. Now, go on, take that first step. The mountain waits for no one.', 0),
(94495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aye, I see it in yer eyes, $R. You\'re wonderin\' what kind o\' soul chooses to live out here, deep in the Wetlands, with Dark Iron scum lurkin\' about and nary a guard in sight. Well, we all have our reasons, love.$B$BBut the real question is, what brings you to our home? Out here at the edge of the falls, I reckon we both know the answer to that.$B$B<Hervdana stretches out her arm, fingers catching mist spray from the waterfall.>', 0),
(94497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Glad ye managed to steer clear o\' the Dark Iron. Shame they\'ve crept so far north--makes ye wonder what dwarfkind could do if the clans ever stopped squabblin\' and worked as one.$B$BStill, the tides rise high when the moons are strong, and the seawater floods the marsh. It\'s here that we study our estuary water.$B$BThank ye for this sacred offering. It marks the beginning of your stage as a vessel--one who seeks the waters\' wisdom.', 0),
(94499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aye, this is good water, $N. The magic used by the shadowseers in the region must be changin\' the murlocs. Nothin\' but pure water, this be. Yer dedication to the task at hand and abilities to seek out that which is needed prove you\'re ready for the next stage of your journey.$B$BOne more sample is all I need to create the reagent needed for your sapta. Norric will be pleased as well.', 0),
(94503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thanks to you. Thanks to the shamans.$B$BCorruption ebbs but life continues to wane. Up to shamans to protect life.', 0),
(94505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aye, this is the proof I asked for, and ye\'ve done well, $N. I\'m proud to be the first to offer my congratulations--and yer water totem. Use it wisely, and may fortune walk beside ye.$B$BYer next trial won\'t come soon, so take this time to learn. Pure water heals, aye, but its gifts go far beyond mending wounds.', 0),
(94669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A very wise choice.', 0),
(94670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'See? What\'d I tell ya. Ain\'t nothin\' to worry about here.', 0),
(94739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hey, hey. Quiet down. I get the excitement, but that ain\'t no reason to rub it in.', 0),
(94774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I\'m glad you\'ve arrived, $N. There are many things we will have to discuss, but more importantly is your training in the ways of the Light.$B$BThere are lessons all servants of the Light must learn. If you are ready, we\'ll begin discussing some of those now.', 0),
(94861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That damn kid...$B$BEven if he is a knucklehead, Curly\'s a good worker. Hopefully he heals up fine and learns some sense. Things could\'ve gone a lot worse if you hadn\'t been there. Thanks for looking out for him.', 0),
(94962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You sure ain\'t makin\' me look good, pal. But I guess that doesn\'t matter much since our ogre friends here seem to be well entertained.$B$BDon\'t let it go to your head.', 0),
(94964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Alright, big shot. Where the heck did you say you was from again?$B$BYou\'re startin\' to make me look bad here.', 0),
(94968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Let this serve as our message.$B$BLok\'tar!', 0),
(94972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'As I suspected, magic bindings and a shadow cipher. It will take time to unlock the secrets within.$B$BNevertheless, your work has been of great help, $N. I will begin my work at once.', 0),
(94974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The moulding should hold. Let\'s see what we can do.', 0),
(95036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Now that we\'ve got the materials we need, we just need a smith to craft the blade for us. I think I know just such a smith.', 0),
(95063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Tiny thing show power in arena. Bring cheers from ogres.$B$BVictory brings new friend to clan. You fight and feast with ogres now.', 0),
(95141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aggro\'gosh sent you? I respect his willingness to support our efforts, though his concerns are his alone.$B$BWe will defeat the humans AND the Twilight\'s Hammer. If it\'s battle you seek, there are plenty of ways to engage your services in the name of the Horde.', 0),
(95143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Tor\'gan sent ya all de way down here ta find me? He always be lookin\' out for me. Hopin\' I\'ll be seein\' him sometime soon.$B$BBut I don\'t be leavin\' my post till de job\'s done, yeah? Long history with Krom\'rosh. Almost as long as Tor\'gan. Almost.$B$BEverything\'s fine here, mon. Nothin\' ta worry bout. \'Cept for them Twilight always bein\' up ta no good. Ol\' Krom\'rosh out by da big fire can tell ya more \'bout that.', 0),
(95183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'These good rocks! Hamur make tiny creature tiny weapon.', 0),
(95214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That should be all the stolen powder. Thank you, $C.$B$BPlease accept this reward, and... I\'d appreciate if you didn\'t mention this little incident to anyone.', 0),
(95250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Truman looks at the head of his former lord in horror and disgust.>$B$BIs this... some kind of joke? Why would you bring me this monstrosity\'s head?$B$BGet out of my sight! I should have known better than to trust a filthy lesser breed like you. The true sons of Lordaeron will reclaim our home. And when we do we\'ll finally be free to purge it of beasts like you!', 0),
(95283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Eitrigg sent you? What does that old wolf want?', 0),
(95322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Venture Co? And the trunk was empty?$B$BThose rotten cheats stole my money! I knew dealin\' with those good-for-nothin\' pirates was bad for business! Nobody goes back on a deal with Ruzzgot and gets away with it.', 0),
(95420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You smash Chogg\'Zac? Little thing shows power.$B$BWhat you want with Clugfist?', 0),
(95425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Skullbasher belong to real ogre. Someday Clugfist pick new champion.', 0),
(95562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It\'s dead? You killed the ogres?$B$BYou\'ve done the right thing, $N. Now let\'s get out of here.', 0),
(95748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent, this is exactly what I need. I have read this tablet before, but that was when I was a young $r. It\'s been many moons since then and my memory is not what it used to be.', 0),
(95951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Nice and sharp. Dey gonna stick good.', 0),
(95955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Impressive work, mon. Ya got de makin\'s of a real headhunter in ya. Just remember ol\' Tan\'jani when ya make it big, haha!', 0),
(95986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, so it is! In that case, well done.$B$BJust so we\'re clear...we agree this matter doesn\'t need to reach Demar, yes? I\'d say we handled it just fine on our own.$B$BThe man already stuck me out here. I don\'t need any more special attention from him.', 0),
(96045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Mana Well. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(96055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Incense Candle. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(96056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Camp Chair. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(96058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Reagent Bot. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(96102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Rallying Banner. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(96105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'And so you are! Well done!$B$BThese plains are a tough land, $N. You have shown yourself to be even tougher.', 0),
(96605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So now that we\'ve learned the basics, why don\'t you go and learn a tradeskill from the trainers in the village nearby. They will also teach you how to create a camp fixture suitable to your new profession.', 0),
(96659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chief Hawkwind sent you? I told him back then I needed no compensation, but it seems he hasn\'t listened. Thank you, $C.$B$BHey, you\'ve got the look of an adventurer yourself. How would you like to learn about camping?', 0),
(96984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh my, a shade of the archmage? How utterly embarrassing for them.$B$BAnd the Kirin Tor allowed you into their inner chambers? Interesting. This could provide an opportunity...', 0),
(97243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So you\'ve brought the torch. Yes, young $C, I can teach you to heed the call of fire. It will not be easy, but nothing that we do in this realm is ever easy.', 0),
(97244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Windshapers do not forget, and blood is always paid with blood. It pleases me that you were able to deliver this final, painful reminder of our creed to this traitor.$B$BThis heart will not be all that feeds the flames today, however. There is one other task that needs to done.', 0),
(97245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We now have what we need. We will light the eternal flame and commune with the spirits of fire.', 0),
(97265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I wish I had been able to watch your battles unfold and hear their wretched screams as they fell to your might.$B$BBut one of them surely eluded your slaughter. The one whose hand I shook in a ritual of spilled blood. So long as he roams the Desolace, I cannot risk stepping foot outside of Shadowprey. He would soon find me again, and with my soulstone in his possession... not even death would be an escape.$B$BEventually, I will have it back. But for now, your work is done.', 0),
(97287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You would give this... willingly?$B$BI do not know your game, $r, but I cannot deny the value of your interference during this delicate time for our people. It\'s not within my power to grant you access to the city at this time, but someday... perhaps. For now, our thanks will have to suffice.', 0),
(97328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You say that all this fell off a zeppelin crash up at the northern side of the jungle, and Bloodscalp trolls had their hands on it? This was supposed to arrive at Powderfuse Port SIX WEEKS ago! We even struck a deal with Grom\'gol to use their zeppelin tower for expedited shipping!$B$BI wondered why Whizzbuzz has been sending me snarky letters. We should have never let Zimmix behind the wheel after what happened the last time.$B$BGreat. Just great. Take this and leave, I have insurance claims to file.', 0),
(97453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, I should have suspected that little Gemmy would try to persuade someone to help out with his situation.$B$BUnfortunately, that was too close of a call when he was out last, and I don\'t even know what else might be lurking out there.$B$BNo, he will not be allowed to step another foot past those gates for another ten years or so. In fact, once his father is back from Booty Bay, he will be heading straight back to Durotar.$B$BYou don\'t have to deliver the news to him, I\'ll do that.', 0),
(97534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Solid haul, sandfoot. I\'ll run \'em through the crusher and sorter to get these off our shelves pronto!$B$BHere, have some silver, go buy yourself a drink.', 0),
(97915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Mana Well. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(97916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Sharpening Wheel. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(97917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Enchanted Lute. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(97921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Incense Candle. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(97923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Lodestone. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
