(97956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Fish Bowl. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(97960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Camp Chair. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(97961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Rallying Banner. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(97964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Sharpening Wheel. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(97973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Rallying Banner. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.', 0),
(98021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I\'ve been begging Stormwind for aid for months and he sends me a skinny elf? Well, beggars can\'t be choosers I suppose.$B$BWelcome to Westfall, $C. Let\'s see if we can\'t put you to work.', 0),
(98203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Dis be the one. A wicked sight.$B$BSpider eggs, maggots, none of dis be what we want in our village.$B$BGo on then with da loa\'s guidance. Revantusk be thanking you for the pest control.', 0),
(98342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent. You have shown you understand the true nature of the cat, and are able to embody the cunning, stealth, and ferocity needed to take my shape.$B$BI now deem you worthy of my blessing, young $C.', 0),
(98386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The mill is that bad? That\'s worse than I thought.$B$BI\'m not particularly squeamish, but work\'s bad enough without spiders snatching up my workers. Thanks for the help, $N!', 0),
(98405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I see you have come to learn to draw upon my spirit. Good. Let us see if you are ready to take my shape.', 0),
(98424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, this is most valuable knowledge. I thank you for your efforts.$B$B<Morin looks through the notes.>$B$BIt seems our next move is clear.', 0),
(98427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'All of Bloodhoof Village is in your debt this day. May the Earth Mother\'s grace stay with you always.', 0),
(98574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'With time and practice, you\'ll discover new facets to the Light. In a way, it\'s finding a union between what you think and what you feel. As you deepen your connection with the Light, you can come back to me to talk about what you\'ve learned. I\'ll be happy to show you how to tap into that force to teach ya how to heal, or to smite the wicked. For a small donation, of course!', 0),
(98731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Dendrite makes another invisible gesture in the air above him as you approach. Another aura of power comes over him, and he smiles ever so slightly.>$B$BI sense the cunning and ferocity of the cat within you that was not present when I sent you to meet the Great Cat Spirit. In your eyes I can sense you now understand the stealth and speed needed to adopt this nature.$B$BNow you may learn to focus your cunning and adopt the true nature of the cat and call upon its spirit.', 0),
(98739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Dendrite makes another invisible gesture in the air above him as you approach. Another aura of power comes over him, and he smiles ever so slightly.>$B$BI sense the cunning and ferocity of the cat within you that was not present when I sent you to meet the Great Cat Spirit. In your eyes I can sense you now understand the stealth and speed needed to adopt this nature.$B$BNow you may learn to focus your cunning and adopt the true nature of the cat and call upon its spirit.', 0),
(98889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The sands of the Darkspear Islands are awash with the blood of the Alliance you\'ve killed. Well done, $N.$B$BFor the Horde!', 0),
(99079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is clear that Malah did not die naturally. Arrows cover her back and the ground nearby.', 0),
(99080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You are covered in centaur blood. Remember this feeling. It is an honor unlike any other among our people.$B$BI could hear the moment the last fell, and their thunderous stampede echoed no longer. Well done!$B$BToday marks a great victory for our village, and a security our young ones need now more than ever. You have my deepest thanks, young $C.', 0),
(99081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This is most dire news indeed. We must inform Baine at once!', 0),
(99082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Galak centaur dare show themselves in Mulgore?!$B$BYou have brought pride to your ancestors by driving them out. Perhaps that will remind them of the pain that awaits them should they do so again!$B$BPlease accept this gift in honor of this. May it serve you well as you venture out into the Earth Mother\'s kingdom, to the far reaches of this world.', 0),
(99101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Baine reads the report, his gaze darkening.>$B$BThis will not stand. Thank you for delivering it to me, $N.', 0),
(99128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I can hear their warbling from here--it\'ll be in my nightmares. Well, that should slow them down--although I have no doubt that they\'ll make up those numbers quickly.', 0),
(99129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I\'ve been warning the guards about the murlocs. They won\'t listen.$B$BI have a few ideas on how to get back at those critters. I\'ll need your help getting what I need for it though.', 0),
(99130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Give me just a minute...$B$BIt\'s pretty simple bait, but as long as nobody\'s pet gets into it, it should be safe. Just tell Jason not to eat any of it.', 0),
(99131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Poisoned bait? As long as the fish aren\'t going to eat it, that should work. I\'ll visit Remy later to pick it up.', 0),
(99143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'An interesting collection. These should work well enough!$B$BHere\'s some of my own older supplies. It should help anyone trying to get their footing in fishing.', 0),
(99191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wonderful!$B$BWe thank you for your generous donation, $N!', 0),
(99196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'We thank you for your generous donation!$B$BWinds be with you, friend.', 0),
(99267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The deceased Night Watchman lying before you is covered in deep gashes and cuts. It\'s clear to see that he was mauled by some sort of large beast.$B$BYou notice that the corpse still has an unlit torch in his hand. You must not have taken it earlier after all.$B$BYou reach down and pry it from his stiff fingers. This could be useful in your travels through Duskwood and beyond to reveal things hidden by darkness.', 0);
